    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stages 1–5 — Ingest → Transcribe → Score → Predict → Ollama Verdict\nEvery box is one `POST` to the Windows runner at `Config.RUNNER_URL`. Transcribe can take a while on CPU, so its timeout is 30 min.\n**Ollama Verdict** is the only call allowed to fail: on error the execution takes the red output into **LLM Unavailable**, which passes the Predict candidates through with `llm: null` so review still happens.\nScores are heuristics (energy, onsets, transcript cues) — not view predictions.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e8d7eed7-05ab-4734-aa06-ffce82a65bb0",
