    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Ollama Verdict failed (runner down mid-run, Ollama off, timeout...). Keep going without the LLM.\nconst predict = $('Predict').first().json;\nconst err = $input.first().json;\nconst reason = (err && (err.error && (err.error.message || err.error))) || err.message || 'request failed';\nconst candidates = (predict.candidates || []).map(c => ({ ...c, llm: null, llm_error: String(reason) }));\nreturn [{ json: { ok: true, candidates, recommended: predict.recommended, llm_error: String(reason) } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "416ff3a2-2765-4c59-aaf8-2c6ca5d871da",
      "name": "LLM Unavailable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2700,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Review — build message, pick channel, wait for a human\n`Build Review Message` renders the exact CONTRACT.md text. `Review Channel` switches on `Config.REVIEW_CHANNEL`.\nOnly **telegram** is wired. Discord / Email placeholders are disabled — see the note below them.\n**Telegram Review** = *Send and Wait for Response*, Free Text, Limit Wait Time 24 h. Free Text in n8n means the bot posts a *Respond* button that opens an n8n-hosted form — so your phone must reach the n8n URL (`WEBHOOK_URL`, LAN IP or tunnel). On timeout the node resumes with no `data.text` → **Replied?** goes false → *Timed out*.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 1200,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "57c34450-8884-47a4-a9e5-b96f0c07f545",
      "name": "Note 17",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3000,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Produce the review text exactly as CONTRACT.md specifies.\nconst cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst ingest = $('Ingest').first().json;\nconst norm = $('Normalize Input').first().json;\nconst transcribe = $('Transcribe').first().json;\nconst inp = $input.first().json;\nconst candidates = inp.candidates || [];\nconst recommended = inp.recommended ?? $('Predict').first().json.recommended ?? null;\n\nfunction hms(sec) {\n  sec = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(sec) || 0));\n  const h = Math.floor(sec / 3600), m = Math.floor((sec % 3600) / 60), s = sec % 60;\n  return `${h}:${String(m).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(s).padStart(2, '0')}`;\n}\nfunction r0(x) { return Math.round(Number(x) || 0); }\n\nconst lines = [];\nlines.push(`🎬 Personal Clipper — ${norm.original || ingest.source} (${hms(ingest.duration_sec)})`);\nif (transcribe && transcribe.words === 0) lines.push(`(transcription: ${transcribe.note || 'no speech detected'} — scores rely on audio only)`);\nfor (const c of candidates) {\n  const p = c.predict || {};\n  const star = (recommended !== null && c.rank === recommended) ? ' ⭐ recommended' : '';\n  lines.push(`#${c.rank}  score ${r0(p.total)}/100  (hook ${r0(p.hook)} · retention ${r0(p.retention)} · clarity ${r0(p.clarity)} · length ${r0(p.length_fit)})   ${hms(c.start)} → ${hms(c.end)}${star}`);\n  lines.push(`    why: ${c.reason || '-'}`);\n  lines.push(`    fix: ${p.biggest_fix || '-'}`);\n  if (c.llm === null || c.llm === undefined) {\n    lines.push(`    llm: (LLM unavailable: ${c.llm_error || inp.llm_error || 'unknown'})`);\n  } else {\n    const flag = c.llm.agrees === false ? '⚠️ disagrees' : '✅ agrees';\n    const fixTxt = c.llm.fix ? ` — fix: ${c.llm.fix}` : '';\n    lines.push(`    llm: \"${c.llm.verdict || ''}\"${fixTxt} ${flag}`);\n  }\n}\nconst hours = cfg.REVIEW_TIMEOUT_HOURS || 24;\nlines.push(`Reply: a number (e.g. 2), \"2 start 5s earlier\", \"2 end 3s later\", or \"reject all\". No reply in ${hours} h = nothing rendered.`);\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  text: lines.join('\\n'),\n  job_id: ingest.job_id,\n  job_dir: ingest.job_dir,\n  input: norm.path,\n  original: norm.original,\n  duration_sec: ingest.duration_sec,\n  candidates,\n  recommended,\n} }];\n"
      },
      "id": "adf8148a-149a-4e8e-829c-135b55d93442",
      "name": "Build Review Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        3000,
        300
      ]
    },
