    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Swapping the review channel\nSet `Config.REVIEW_CHANNEL` and wire ONE branch of `Review Channel` into `Replied?`.\n\n**Discord**: create a bot in the Discord Developer Portal, add a *Discord Bot* credential, enable the node, set Server/Channel. Discord Send-and-Wait supports *approval* (buttons) only — free-text offsets are not available, so the reply you get is `{ data: { approved: true|false } }`; adapt `Parse Reply` to treat approved = recommended rank.\n\n**Email**: add a *Gmail OAuth2* credential, enable the node, set *Send To*. Gmail Send-and-Wait supports *free text*, and the output is the same `{ data: { text } }` shape, so `Parse Reply` works unchanged.\n\nBoth placeholders are disabled and unwired on purpose. Do not wire all three.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 6
      },
