    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stages 6–7 — Render → Package → Deliver → Log\n`/render` runs `src\\main.py --preset shorts` with safe-zone `captions.ass` (30 min timeout). `/package` builds the `*_capcut\\` folder (clip, captions.srt, transcript, EditPilot prompts, steps, social copy). Deliver posts the result to Telegram. `/log` appends to `runs.jsonl` and marks the file processed.\nNothing is uploaded or posted anywhere — you do that by hand.",
